The approved build brief (.checkpoints/netcode-proof-test/c62h-bound-brief.md, sha256 7936074c..., section 3.1;
Mustafa's C62H-BOUND-YES (a), 2026-11-15 20:50 Amsterdam), route W's launch 1. npt-l1 gains DatagramCounts and
FateLog::server_datagrams_since (read only: down datagrams from an index, by fate); npt-lab joins it one to one with
each slot's snapshot groups at the send (link_lost: the run fails on a mismatch), writes the room log's new series
tick.s.snap_link_lost_count, tallies each measured client-tick filed lost as E1 / E2 / N, and prints them in the summary
line; the bites build adds the PM-0001-17/link-lost-overstated plant. B-1: SERIES.md's (18) to (19) header and the
frozen tick.s.snap_link_lost_count row, put in by the main session's c62h_bound_insert.py --part 1 (89295b57...).

Evidence (.gate/u4r/c62h-bound/): check.mjs whole on the staged content, all 11 steps PASS (step1-check.log; measured
545, bites 625: +7 / +9 as the brief expects); planted bugs CB-P1 to CB-P7, CB-P12 and CB-P13 each bit its home test
(plant-CB-*.log), each file restored to its recorded sha256; SIZE-CHECK from LANE_BASE 044fab1: 499 lines.

